# VYRO — Smart System Monitor

A lightweight, cross-platform system monitoring CLI built with Python. Track CPU usage, memory consumption, disk space, running processes, and system health from a clean terminal interface.

## Features

* Live CPU and memory monitoring
* Disk usage overview
* Top processes by CPU and memory consumption
* Configurable resource usage warnings
* JSON report export
* Continuous monitoring mode
* Cross-platform support for Windows, Linux, and macOS
* Graceful error handling and clean terminal output

