## Installation

```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/vyro-system-monitor.git
cd vyro-system-monitor
python -m venv .venv
```

Activate the virtual environment:

**Windows PowerShell**

```powershell
.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
```

**Linux / macOS**

```bash
source .venv/bin/activate
```

Install dependencies:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

## Usage

Display a system report:

```bash
python vyro.py
```

Monitor the system continuously:

```bash
python vyro.py --watch
```

Set custom warning thresholds:

```bash
python vyro.py --cpu-limit 85 --memory-limit 90
```

Export a JSON report:

```bash
python vyro.py --json report.json
```

Display more running processes:

```bash
python vyro.py --top 15
```

## Requirements

* Python 3.10+
* psutil

